     * @apiNote This method handles positive numbers; for negative numbers,
     * the behavior may not match expectations for "decimal part".
     * 
     * Examples:
     * <pre>{@code
     * truncateNumber(3.5) == 0.5
     * truncateNumber(2.0) == 0.0
