     *
     * @param numbers the list of integers to intersperse
     * @param delimiter the value to insert between consecutive elements
     * @return a new list with {@code delimiter} inserted between every pair of consecutive elements
     *         from {@code numbers}; returns an empty list if {@code numbers} is empty
     * @throws NullPointerException if {@code numbers} is null
     *
     * Examples:
     * <ul>
